# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
SVGS = ['<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">ARAPÇADA MEMLEKET SORMA VE NİSPET YÂ\'SI (تُرْكِيٌّ / تُرْكِيَّةٌ)</text>\n  <rect x="25" y="42" width="315" height="200" rx="10" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e40af">MEMLEKET SORMA (مِنْ أَيْنَ ...؟)</text>\n  <text x="40" y="92" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e3a8a">• Müzekker (Erkek Muhatap):</text>\n  <text x="48" y="112" font-size="12" fill="#1d4ed8">مِنْ أَيْنَ أَنْتَ؟ → أَنَا مِنْ تُرْكِيَا. (Nerelisin? Türkiye\'denim.)</text>\n  <text x="40" y="138" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e3a8a">• Müennes (Kadın Muhatap):</text>\n  <text x="48" y="158" font-size="12" fill="#1d4ed8">مِنْ أَيْنَ أَنْتِ؟ → أَنَا مِنْ فِلَسْطِينَ. (Ben Filistin\'denim.)</text>\n  <text x="40" y="184" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#1e3a8a">• Üçüncü Şahıs (O):</text>\n  <text x="48" y="204" font-size="12" fill="#1d4ed8">مِنْ أَيْنَ هُوَ / هِيَ؟ → هُوَ مِنْ أَذَرْبِيجَانَ.</text>\n  <text x="182" y="228" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#334155">مِنْ (-den/-dan) harf-i cerri ülke isimlerinden önce gelir.</text>\n  <rect x="355" y="42" width="320" height="200" rx="10" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#d97706" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="515" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#92400e">MİLLİYET (İSM-İ MENSUB / NİSPET YÂ\'SI)</text>\n  <rect x="372" y="80" width="286" height="36" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#f59e0b"/>\n  <text x="515" y="103" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#78350f">Ülke + ـِيٌّ (Erkek)  |  Ülke + ـِيَّةٌ (Kadın)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="138" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">• تُرْكِيَا (Türkiye) → تُرْكِيٌّ (Türk erkek) / تُرْكِيَّةٌ (Türk kadın)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="162" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">• مِصْرُ (Mısır) → مِصْرِيٌّ (Mısırlı erkek) / مِصْرِيَّةٌ (Mısırlı kadın)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="186" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">• سُورِيَا (Suriye) → سُورِيٌّ (Suriyeli erkek) / سُورِيَّةٌ (Suriyeli kadın)</text>\n  <text x="375" y="210" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">• فِلَسْطِينُ (Filistin) → فِلَسْطِينِيٌّ / فِلَسْطِينِيَّةٌ</text>\n  <text x="515" y="230" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#b45309">Sonundaki elif (ا) düşürülerek şeddeli yâ (ـِيّ) eklenir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">BELİRLİ-BELİRSİZ İSİMLER (التَّعْرِيف والتَّنْكِير) VE EMİR FİİLLERİ</text>\n  <rect x="25" y="42" width="315" height="200" rx="10" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="182" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">NEKRE (BELİRSİZ) VE MARİFE (BELİRLİ)</text>\n  <text x="40" y="95" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#14532d">• Nekre (Tenvinli): Bir ... (Belirsiz)</text>\n  <text x="48" y="115" font-size="12" fill="#15803d">طَالِبٌ (bir öğrenci)  —  مُدَرِّسٌ (bir öğretmen)</text>\n  <text x="40" y="145" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#14532d">• Marife (Elif-Lâm\'lı): ... (Belirli, tenvin düşer!)</text>\n  <text x="48" y="165" font-size="12" fill="#15803d">اَلطَّالِبُ (öğrenci)  —  اَلْمُدَرِّسُ (öğretmen)</text>\n  <rect x="40" y="182" width="285" height="46" rx="6" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#22c55e"/>\n  <text x="182" y="201" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">Önemli Kural:</text>\n  <text x="182" y="218" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#14532d">Elif-lâm (ال) alan kelimenin sonundaki tenvin kalkar, tek hareke kalır.</text>\n  <rect x="355" y="42" width="320" height="200" rx="10" fill="#faf5ff" stroke="#9333ea" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="515" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">SINIF İÇİ EMİR İFADELERİ (مُذَكَّر / مُؤَنَّث)</text>\n  <text x="372" y="95" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• Konuş! → تَكَلَّمْ (Erkek)  /  تَكَلَّمِي (Kadın)</text>\n  <text x="372" y="122" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• Sus! → اُسْكُتْ (Erkek)  /  اُسْكُتِي (Kadın)</text>\n  <text x="372" y="149" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• Gel! → تَعَالَ (Erkek)  /  تَعَالَيْ (Kadın)</text>\n  <text x="372" y="176" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#581c87">• Git! → اِذْهَبْ (Erkek)  /  اِذْهَبِي (Kadın)</text>\n  <rect x="372" y="192" width="286" height="36" rx="6" fill="#f3e8ff" stroke="#a855f7"/>\n  <text x="515" y="214" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#6b21a8">Müennes emirlerde fiilin sonuna muhataba yâ\'sı (ـي) eklenir.</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="260" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="26" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">TANIŞMA DİYALOĞU VE EVET/HAYIR (هَلْ ...؟ → نَعَمْ / لَا)</text>\n  <rect x="25" y="42" width="650" height="200" rx="10" fill="#fff7ed" stroke="#ea580c" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="350" y="65" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">ÖRNEK TANIŞMA VE SORU-CEVAP KALIPLARI</text>\n  <rect x="45" y="78" width="295" height="70" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#fdba74"/>\n  <text x="60" y="100" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#c2410c">أَحْمَدُ: السَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ، مَا اسْمُكَ؟</text>\n  <text x="60" y="120" font-size="12" fill="#7c2d12">كَرِيمٌ: وَعَلَيْكُمُ السَّلَامُ، اِسْمِي كَرِيمٌ.</text>\n  <text x="60" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#9a3412">(Selamün aleyküm, adın ne? — Adım Kerim.)</text>\n  <rect x="360" y="78" width="295" height="70" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#fdba74"/>\n  <text x="375" y="100" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#c2410c">أَحْمَدُ: مِنْ أَيْنَ أَنْتَ يَا كَرِيمُ؟</text>\n  <text x="375" y="120" font-size="12" fill="#7c2d12">كَرِيمٌ: أَنَا مِنْ تُرْكِيَا، أَنَا تُرْكِيٌّ.</text>\n  <text x="375" y="138" font-size="11" fill="#9a3412">(Nerelisin ey Kerim? — Türkiye\'denim, Türk\'üm.)</text>\n  <rect x="45" y="158" width="610" height="70" rx="8" fill="#ffedd5" stroke="#fb923c"/>\n  <text x="60" y="180" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">• هَلْ هَذَا مُدِيرٌ؟ (Bu bir müdür müdür?) → نَعَمْ، هَذَا مُدِيرٌ. (Evet, bu bir müdürdür.)</text>\n  <text x="60" y="202" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#9a3412">• هَلْ هِيَ مُدَرِّسَةٌ؟ (O bir kadın öğretmen midir?) → لَا، هِيَ طَالِبَةٌ. (Hayır, o bir kız öğrencidir.)</text>\n  <text x="60" y="220" font-size="11" fill="#7c2d12">Not: صَدِيقٌ (erkek arkadaş) / صَدِيقَةٌ (kız arkadaş)  |  مُدِيرٌ (erkek müdür) / مُدِيرَةٌ (kadın müdür)</text>\n</svg>']

def uygula(v):
    for i, b in enumerate(v.get('bolumler', [])):
        if i < len(SVGS):
            b['gorsel'] = SVGS[i]
